      "originalText": "Communications Systems Troubleshooting",
      "lineHeight": 1.4
    },
    {
      "id": "cst_intro",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 32,
      "y": 1336,
      "width": 656,
      "height": 74,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1f2937",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 158,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 159,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1708800000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Quality control is one of the main goals for many communication design specialists. We\nstrive to minimize potential product mistakes as a result of technological advancements.\nAn estimated 50% of all network failures have been attributed to improper installation\nprocedures. This may be caused by a number of different point-of-failures, including:",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Quality control is one of the main goals for many communication design specialists. We\nstrive to minimize potential product mistakes as a result of technological advancements.\nAn estimated 50% of all network failures have been attributed to improper installation\nprocedures. This may be caused by a number of different point-of-failures, including:",
      "lineHeight": 1.4
    },
    {
      "id": "cst_list",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 32,
      "y": 1430,
      "width": 656,
      "height": 107,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1f2937",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 160,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 161,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1708800000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "• Incorrect installation procedures\n• Installed cable is longer than what BICSI advises\n• Overly tense situation in the cables\n• Kinks or twists in the cables\n• Bend radiuses outside of what the manufacturer specifies\n• Failure at terminals",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "• Incorrect installation procedures\n• Installed cable is longer than what BICSI advises\n• Overly tense situation in the cables\n• Kinks or twists in the cables\n• Bend radiuses outside of what the manufacturer specifies\n• Failure at terminals",
      "lineHeight": 1.4
    },
    {
      "id": "cst_close",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 32,
      "y": 1548,
      "width": 656,
      "height": 40,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1f2937",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
